== Current status ==
The certification process for the gathered signatures began on 10 June 2025, and was officially completed on 25 September 2025, with 96.3% of all signatures being certified as valid. 

The amendment has now entered the formal deliberation phase through the [[Open Cabildo]], which is expected to last for several months. Political analysts consider the outcome of the eventual referendum to be highly uncertain. The campaign has created unusual alliances and deep divisions across the political spectrum. The debate over the cantonal veto is seen as a critical test of Balisca's founding principles as the country confronts many of the the unprecedented challenges of the 21st century.

